  "content": "<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"ip-cover-img bg-center bg-cover\" style='background-image: url(\"/content/dam/dnd-mdn/images/test/beta-banner4.jpg\");'> \n\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row mrgn-bttm-md\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-7\">\n\t\t\t\t<h1 property=\"name\" id=\"wb-cont\">National Defence</h1> \n    <p> The Department of National Defence supports the Canadian Armed Forces who serve on the sea, on land, and in the air with the <a href=\"/en/navy.html\">Navy</a>, <a href=\"/en/army.html\">Army</a>, <a href=\"/en/air-force.html\">Air Force</a> and <a href=\"/en/special-operations-forces-command.html\">Special Forces</a> to defend Canadians’ interests at home and abroad.</p> \n    <a class=\"btn btn-call-to-action ip-btn\" href=\"https://forces.ca/en/careers/\">Find a job in the Forces</a> \n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"provisional gc-most-requested well well-sm brdr-0 mrgn-tp-0\"><div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"pddng-r-0 col-md-2\">\n          <h2 class=\"mrgn-tp-md\">Most requested</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-md-11\"> \n          \n           \n        <ul class=\"wb-eqht mrgn-tp-md mrgn-bttm-md colcount-md-2 wb-init wb-eqht-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-4\"><li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 24px;\"><a href=\"/en/department-national-defence/services/benefits-military/pay-pension-benefits/pay.html\">Military pay rates</a></li>\n  <li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 24px;\"><a href=\"https://emploisfp-psjobs.cfp-psc.gc.ca/psrs-srfp/applicant/page2440?classificationInfos=&amp;locationsFilter=&amp;officialLanguage=&amp;title=&amp;referenceNumber=&amp;tab=1&amp;search=Search%20jobs&amp;selectionProcessNumber=&amp;departments=40&amp;log=false\">Civilian job openings</a></li>\n  <li style=\"vertical-align: top;